('zero',C,'The nilpotent is explicitly zero because the pyramid has a single column. Consequently every truncated polynomial variable acts by zero and the right algebra is the symmetric-group algebra; the verification computes its mutual centralizers directly rather than excluding this degeneration.','Example; F1–F2; Proof1.1–2.1'),
